      "computation_change_reason": "Defines time-staged pH numeric limits and ties measurement timing to use/disposal or bagging events; different readings of when the clock starts and whether pH was maintained without further alkali change applicable limits (A), monitoring timing obligations (B), and how to treat missing pH time-series evidence (C)."
